{"content":"# Reply — BLOCKING: pre-checkout workspace dependency (build-macos.yml)

Fixed at all mirror call sites. The `Update local git mirrors` step no longer reads anything from `$GITHUB_WORKSPACE`: the script is bootstrapped into `$RUNNER_TEMP` from the commit-pinned raw URL (`curl -fsSL --retry 5 --retry-all-errors .../${{ github.sha }}/scripts/update_git_mirror.sh` — valid because these workflows are `workflow_dispatch`-only, so `github.sha` is always a pushed commit), with `git --git-dir="$MIRROR" show "$BRANCH:scripts/update_git_mirror.sh"` as the no-network fallback. Both sources failing exits 1 with a precise `::error::`. Verified end-to-end by executing the verbatim YAML run block in a sandbox: curl-down→mirror-fallback, curl-up, and both-down→exit 1 all behave correctly, and the workspace is never referenced.
","path":"outputs/review_replies/thread_1.md"}

{"content":"# Reply — BLOCKING: same first-run failure mode at `build-ios`

Same bootstrap applied at both `build-ios` and `submit-ios` mirror steps in `build-mobile.yml`: the updater is fetched pinned to `${{ github.sha }}` (with the mirror-copy fallback and `::error::` exit on total bootstrap failure) into `$RUNNER_TEMP`, so no pre-checkout workspace content is assumed. Both run blocks verified by executing the verbatim YAML (`bash -n` clean, functional sandbox test of all three bootstrap paths).
","path":"outputs/review_replies/thread_2.md"}

{"content":"# Reply — SUGGESTION: recreate into a temp dir and swap on success

Implemented in `scripts/update_git_mirror.sh`: `recreate_mirror` now clones into the sibling `"$mirror.recreate"` and, only on a successful blobless clone, does `rm -rf "$mirror" && mv "$tmp" "$mirror"`. On exhaustion the temp dir is removed and the last good mirror is left in place; the header contract comment was updated to match. New selftest scenario T8 (all fetch + clone attempts fault-injected to fail) asserts nonzero exit, `::error::`, unchanged mirror head, and no `.recreate` leftover — T8 was confirmed RED against the old logic before the fix. Selftest now 10/10, legacy repro 4/4.
